<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Action Prompt</h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The user-turn message is constructed dynamically at each decision point and packages the full state the agent needs: table identity, blind level, persistent memory, the current situation, players in the hand, running stats, and the action history. Bracketed tokens show the variable fields that are interpolated per call.</p>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<div id="A5.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx74" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx74.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">You</span><span id="lstnumberx74.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">are</span><span id="lstnumberx74.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[</span><span id="lstnumberx74.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">PLAYER_NAME</span><span id="lstnumberx74.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">],</span><span id="lstnumberx74.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">playing</span><span id="lstnumberx74.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">Texas</span><span id="lstnumberx74.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">Hold</span><span id="lstnumberx74.14" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">’</span><span id="lstnumberx74.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">em</span><span id="lstnumberx74.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">poker</span><span id="lstnumberx74.18" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.</span>
