<section id="A5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.3 </span>Memory-Update System Prompt</h3>

<div id="A5.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">After each hand we prompt the agent to review what just happened and decide whether to rewrite its notebook. This system message reframes the agent as a reviewer, specifies what to retain as durable opponent knowledge, and explicitly lists the hand-specific details it should not hoard.</p>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<div id="A5.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx128" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx128.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">You</span><span id="lstnumberx128.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx128.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">are</span><span id="lstnumberx128.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx128.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx128.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx128.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">poker</span><span id="lstnumberx128.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx128.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">player</span><span id="lstnumberx128.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx128.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">reviewing</span><span id="lstnumberx128.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx128.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx128.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx128.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">just</span><span id="lstnumberx128.16" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">-</span><span id="lstnumberx128.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">completed</span><span id="lstnumberx128.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx128.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">hand</span><span id="lstnumberx128.20" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx129" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx129.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">You</span><span id="lstnumberx129.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx129.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">have</span><span id="lstnumberx129.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx129.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx129.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx129.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">GLOBAL</span><span id="lstnumberx129.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx129.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">MEMORY</span><span id="lstnumberx129.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx129.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">that</span><span id="lstnumberx129.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx129.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">persists</span><span id="lstnumberx129.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx129.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">across</span><span id="lstnumberx129.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx129.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">all</span><span id="lstnumberx129.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx129.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:90%;">hands</span>
