<section id="A5.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.4 </span>Memory-Update User Prompt</h3>

<div id="A5.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The user message for the memory-update turn delivers the completed hand in full, together with the current global memory, and asks the agent to return either an updated memory blob or a no-op marker.</p>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<div id="A5.SS4.p2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
