<div id="A6.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Notes.</span> Post denotes the postflop action-token budget and Pre denotes the preflop action-token budget. The Reasoning column shows <span id="A6.SS2.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">max_tokens</span> for Claude, <span id="A6.SS2.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">enabled: true</span> for Gemini, Grok, and Kimi, <span id="A6.SS2.p2.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">effort: medium</span> for GPT, and none for models without an extended-reasoning configuration.</p>
