</section>
<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>Extended Results and Statistical Tests</h2>

<section id="A7.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">G.1 </span>Per-Model Per-Session Chip Delta</h3>

<div id="A7.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A7.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ G.1 Per-Model Per-Session Chip Delta ‣ Appendix G Extended Results and Statistical Tests ‣ Poker Arena: Multi-Axis Profiling of Strategic Reasoning and Memory in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> reports chip profit and loss (final minus starting chips, with <math id="A7.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta=0</annotation></semantics></math> meaning break-even) for each model across all 50 sessions. Session 40 has no Kimi entry because Kimi was eliminated before the session ended and that final record was not written.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A7.T5.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:129%;">Table 5</span>: </span><span id="A7.T5.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:129%;">Per-session chip delta ($) for all 7 models. All sessions start
at 1000 chips. Positive = profit; negative = loss.</span></figcaption>
<table id="A7.T5.7" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A7.T5.7.1" class="ltx_tr">
