<section id="A7.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">G.2 </span>VPIP, PFR, and AF by Position</h3>

<div id="A7.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A7.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ G.2 VPIP, PFR, and AF by Position ‣ Appendix G Extended Results and Statistical Tests ‣ Poker Arena: Multi-Axis Profiling of Strategic Reasoning and Memory in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> reports aggregate VPIP by position, computed from the 50-session dataset using the same logic as M9. The final row gives the GTO reference values for comparison; when seven players are at the table, the 7-max reference row is used.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Per-model VPIP by position (6/7-max, all 50 sessions).
