<div id="A7.SS4.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.SS4.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Claude and Kimi are the only models whose cumulative-delta intervals exclude zero. The corresponding 95% confidence intervals on mean metric score are:</p>
</div>
<div id="A7.SS4.p5" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A7.SS4.p5.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
