<div id="A7.SS4.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.SS4.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Ranking models by mean metric score and by cumulative chip delta yields the Spearman rank correlation between cognitive and financial orderings:</p>
</div>
<div id="A7.SS4.p7" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A7.SS4.p7.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A7.SS4.p7.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
