<th id="A7.SS4.p7.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">GPT</th>
<td id="A7.SS4.p7.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">4</td>
<td id="A7.SS4.p7.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">4</td></tr>
<tr id="A7.SS4.p7.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A7.SS4.p7.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Gemini</th>
<td id="A7.SS4.p7.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">6</td>
<td id="A7.SS4.p7.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">5</td></tr>
<tr id="A7.SS4.p7.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A7.SS4.p7.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Grok</th>
<td id="A7.SS4.p7.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">1</td>
<td id="A7.SS4.p7.1.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">2</td></tr>
<tr id="A7.SS4.p7.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A7.SS4.p7.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">DeepSeek</th>
<td id="A7.SS4.p7.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">2</td>
<td id="A7.SS4.p7.1.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">3</td></tr>
<tr id="A7.SS4.p7.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A7.SS4.p7.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Qwen</th>
<td id="A7.SS4.p7.1.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">3</td>
<td id="A7.SS4.p7.1.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">6</td></tr>
<tr id="A7.SS4.p7.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A7.SS4.p7.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Kimi</th>
<td id="A7.SS4.p7.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">7</td>
<td id="A7.SS4.p7.1.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">7</td></tr>
<tr id="A7.SS4.p7.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A7.SS4.p7.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t"><math id="A7.SS4.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho_{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho_{S}</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<td id="A7.SS4.p7.1.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" colspan="2"><math id="A7.SS4.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.571" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.571</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.571</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.SS4.p7.1.10" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A7.SS4.p7.1.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb"><math id="A7.SS4.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math>-value</th>
<td id="A7.SS4.p7.1.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" colspan="2"><math id="A7.SS4.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.180" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.180</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.180</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A7.SS4.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.SS4.p8.1" class="ltx_p">The Spearman <math id="A7.SS4.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho=0.571" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.571</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho=0.571</annotation></semantics></math> indicates moderate positive alignment between cognitive skill and financial outcome, but does not reach significance at the 0.05 level given only seven models. Claude’s high chip profit despite a mid-tier metric score reflects the high variance of poker outcomes.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix H </span>Annotated Hand Traces</h2>

<div id="A8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We annotate three hands that illustrate qualitatively distinct model behaviours. Action amounts are in chips throughout.</p>
</div>
<section id="A8.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">H.1 </span>Claude’s Four-Bet Squeeze in Session 38</h3>

<div id="A8.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Session 38 ended with Claude at <math id="A8.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="+3{,}475" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3,475</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">+3{,}475</annotation></semantics></math> chips, the single highest per-session gain in the dataset, and hand 17 was the decisive pot. Blinds stood at $50/$100 (the fourth blind level in a twenty-hand session), and Claude held A<math id="A8.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\heartsuit" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">♡</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\heartsuit</annotation></semantics></math>Q<math id="A8.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\heartsuit" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">♡</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\heartsuit</annotation></semantics></math> in the big blind. Although the community cards eventually ran out 6<math id="A8.SS1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\diamondsuit" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">♢</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\diamondsuit</annotation></semantics></math> K<math id="A8.SS1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\diamondsuit" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">♢</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\diamondsuit</annotation></semantics></math> 2<math id="A8.SS1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\spadesuit" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">♠</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\spadesuit</annotation></semantics></math> 8<math id="A8.SS1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\heartsuit" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">♡</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\heartsuit</annotation></semantics></math> 8<math id="A8.SS1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\clubsuit" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">♣</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\clubsuit</annotation></semantics></math>, the hand was effectively decided preflop when GPT went all-in and Grok folded.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A8.T9" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>Hand trace: Session 38, Hand 17 (preflop only).</figcaption>
