<td id="A8.T10.5.5.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="A8.T10.5.5.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">“air, fold equity”</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A8.T10.5.6" class="ltx_tr">
