<td id="A8.T10.5.6.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="A8.T10.5.6.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">backdoor draws, overcard</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A8.T10.5.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A8.T10.5.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="A8.T10.5.7.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Turn [2c]</span></td>
